---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ThemeToggle from '../components/ThemeToggle.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Solutions architect and cloud engineer based in Dhaka, Bangladesh.">
  <div class="container container--wide">
    <div class="about">
      <div class="about__top">
        <ThemeToggle />
      </div>

      <div class="about__header">
        <div class="about__photo">
          <div class="about__photo-placeholder">
            <span>Photo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="about__title">About</h1>
          <p class="about__tagline">Solutions architect and cloud engineer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about__content">
        <p>
          I'm a solutions architect and software engineer based in Dhaka, Bangladesh, with over
          four years of experience designing and building cloud-native platforms, API interfaces,
          and distributed systems.
        </p>

        <p>
          I currently work as a Solutions Architect at NexGen Cloud, where I design scalable
          cloud-native solutions for a GPU-as-a-Service platform serving thousands of customers
          across multiple regions. Before that, I helped build the platform from its early stages
          as a developer, taking it from MVP to production.
        </p>

        <p>
          My work sits at the intersection of architecture and engineering. I care about how
          systems are designed, how they scale, and how they hold up under real-world conditions.
          I've worked extensively with Python, microservices architecture, container orchestration,
          and cloud infrastructure optimization.
        </p>

        <h2>What I Do</h2>

        <p>
          Most of my time is spent on:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Designing system architectures for cloud-native platforms</li>
          <li>Building and scaling API interfaces and distributed systems</li>
          <li>Optimizing infrastructure for performance and cost</li>
          <li>Working with GPU cloud infrastructure and multi-region deployments</li>
          <li>Architecture reviews and technical strategy</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Background</h2>

        <p>
          I graduated with a BSc in Computer Science &amp; Engineering from Chittagong University
          of Engineering &amp; Technology (CUET) in 2021. During university, I was actively
          involved in the CUET Computer Club, serving as Vice President and as a competitive
          programming trainer.
        </p>

        <p>
          Before moving into architecture, I spent time as a software engineer building
          production systems including load balancer automation, object storage integrations, automated
          billing systems, and high-availability deployments using Kubernetes.
        </p>

        <h2>Why This Site</h2>

        <p>
          This site is where I collect my thoughts on engineering, architecture, and the things
          I'm learning. It's not a polished publication. It's a working document of my thinking.
          Some posts will be rough notes. Others will be more considered essays. Both are valuable
          to me.
        </p>

        <p>
          Writing forces clarity. You don't know what you think until you try to explain it.
        </p>

        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>

        <p>
          <a href="mailto:mail@simonislam.com">mail@simonislam.com</a><br />
          <a href="https://github.com/simon7426">GitHub</a><br />
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/simon-islam-rian/">LinkedIn</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  .about__top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about__header {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .about__photo-placeholder {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  }

  .about__title {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about__tagline {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .about__content {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about__content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about__content h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .about__content ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about__content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .about__content a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--border-strong);
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .about__content a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about__header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
